(text "Pins stand up from this board and the Jewel is soldered on top,\nLEDs up. Pad positions come from Adafruit's NeoJewel 7 board file\n(github.com/adafruit/Adafruit-NeoPixel-Jewel-7); test-fit your Jewel\nbefore ordering. Both Jewel GND pads are used; DOUT is unused.\nJ2: holes for a 3-wire JST-XH pigtail (1 +5V, 2 DIN, 3 GND), same\norder as J5 on the Sigil board. C1 470 uF 10 V electrolytic,\n+ to +5V, is the ring bulk capacitor. The Jewel already has a\n470 ohm resistor on DIN; the Sigil board adds U2 and R1." (at 25.4 110 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1f2e4e15-69b3-5227-98da-ce3fccae9cc0"))
(embedded_fonts no))
